	quest_links: [ ]
	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Summonity 是一个完整的召唤师职业，直接建立在 Terramity 之上。其中几乎所有配方都需要 Terramity 的材料，所以这两个模组实际上不可分割。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你会获得为你战斗的</grad><grad from=#6EC5E8 to=#C8ECFA f=0.8>仆从</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，以及告诉它们该去哪里的</grad><grad from=#6EC5E8 to=#C8ECFA f=0.8>鞭子</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#6EC5E8 to=#C8ECFA f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>统计数据</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#6EC5E8 to=#C8ECFA f=0.8>随从槽位</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>：可拥有的随从数量。初始为 </grad><grad from=#6EC5E8 to=#C8ECFA f=0.8>1</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 个。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#6EC5E8 to=#C8ECFA f=0.8>随从范围</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>：随从的追逐距离和炮台的射击距离。初始值为 </grad><grad from=#6EC5E8 to=#C8ECFA f=0.8>20 格</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#6EC5E8 to=#C8ECFA f=0.8>随从伤害</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>, </grad><grad from=#6EC5E8 to=#C8ECFA f=0.8>随从攻击速度</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>, </grad><grad from=#6EC5E8 to=#C8ECFA f=0.8>随从移动速度</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: 所有倍率，初始均为 </grad><grad from=#6EC5E8 to=#C8ECFA f=0.8>1.0</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#6EC5E8 to=#C8ECFA f=0.8>鞭子伤害</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>, </grad><grad from=#6EC5E8 to=#C8ECFA f=0.8>鞭子范围</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>, </grad><grad from=#6EC5E8 to=#C8ECFA f=0.8>鞭子攻击速度</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: 鞭子部分也同理。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warning] 除非主手拿着召唤杖或鞭子，否则仆从的伤害会减半。手持剑会使你的整支军队实力减半。"
				""
				"[!info] 按 {Focus Minion} 键或用鞭子抽打目标，都能让你的仆从攻击该目标。潜行并按右键使用鞭子可取消锁定。"
				""
				"{ \"text\": \"Back to Terramity\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"#8FCB3F\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"2F1A384416C57A23\" } }"
			]
			icon: "summonity:stardust_dragon_staff"
			id: "65D24349F4F35A99"
