			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>导电法杖</grad><grad from=#6EC5E8 to=#C8ECFA f=0.8>会召唤一个</grad><grad from=#6EC5E8 to=#C8ECFA f=0.8>铜傀儡，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>基础伤害为</grad><grad from=#6EC5E8 to=#C8ECFA f=0.8>2.0。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>铜制控制器会召唤出会飞的</grad><grad from=#6EC5E8 to=#C8ECFA f=0.8>铜制无人机，它们会与你绑定且完全无害。潜行并左键点击可切换它们的工作模式：</grad></shadow>"
