				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#6EC5E8 to=#C8ECFA f=0.8>护甲</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>：每架无人机提供 </grad><grad from=#6EC5E8 to=#C8ECFA f=0.8>+2 护甲</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
